DESCRIPTION >
    Events health check: most recent event timestamp (any event type).
    Tenant-scoped; prunes via (site_id, timestamp). Faithful 1:1 port of
    api/routes/events.js:226-232 (queryName 'events_health_last').
    Typed-column translation: properties.site_id -> site_id; timestamp
    unchanged (already typed top-level). Source has NO event_type filter
    (matches any event) — preserved exactly. No JSON-bag fields.
    NOT YET PUSHED — validated read-only via `tb --cloud sql` only.

NODE events_health_last_node
SQL >
    %
    SELECT timestamp
    FROM events
    WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
    ORDER BY timestamp DESC
    LIMIT 1

TYPE endpoint
